<title>USA: Sterling Vision names Lewis president/COO.</title>
<headline>Sterling Vision names Lewis president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>EAST MEADOW, N.Y. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Vision Inc said it named Jerry Lewis as its president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Robert Greenberg, chief executive officer, had held the position of president in an acting capacity since 1995. Greenberg will continue as CEO, he said.</p>
<p>Before his appointment, Lewis was managing director of Specsavers Optical Group 's superstores.</p>
<p>Sterling Vision is a chain of 350 company-owned and franchised retail optical and eye care stores.</p>
</text>
